{
  "slug": "dbt-toolkit",
  "name": "Dbt Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Workflow-oriented dbt project management for Claude Code",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **2 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `dbt` (dbt project management — run, test, debug, audit, and more), `dbt-artifacts` (Parse run results, explore manifest, compare states, inspect catalog), `dbt-audit` (Proactive health checks — test coverage, docs, materialization, sort/dist keys), `dbt-brainstorming` (Explore model design decisions — materialization, incremental strategy, sources (v2 — not yet implemented)), `dbt-code-review` (Model review checklist — SQL quality, config, tests, docs (v2 — not yet implemented)), `dbt-debug` (Systematic troubleshooting for connection, compilation, SQL, and test failures), `dbt-deps` (Install and manage dbt packages — dbt-utils, dbt-expectations, custom packages), `dbt-develop` (Scaffold new models, compile and preview SQL, explore lineage, refactor), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (2): `lineage-agent`, `test-failure-agent`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dbt-toolkit@claude-community` from `rishav1305/dbt-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
